<title>USA: U.S. DLA sold no ferromanganese.</title>
<headline>U.S. DLA sold no ferromanganese.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said Monday said it made no awards for ferromanganese from its offering of September 16.</p>
<p>DLA said ferromanganese is offered for sale on the fourth Tuesday of each month. Offers on the next offering are due October 22, it said.</p>
